+///  - both operands' NaN tests are present and the root can be rewritten with the swapped inverse compare:
+///      NAN(a)||NAN(b)|| a<b   ==  !(b<=a)          NAN(a)||NAN(b)|| a<=b  ==  !(b<a)
+///      !NAN(a)&&!NAN(b)&& !(a<b) ==  b<=a          !NAN(a)&&!NAN(b)&& !(a<=b) ==  b<a
